## B2B PREMIUM SOURCE ASSESSMENT

| Provider | Catalog Size | Quality Range | Notable Titles | Licensing Model | PlayThorn Value |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Famobi** | 500+ | HIGH (Polished mobile-quality) | Cut the Rope series, Om Nom Run, casual sports | B2B licensing packages (S/M/L/Enterprise), contact sales@famobi.com | HIGH — Official licensed famous IPs |
| **GameDistribution** | 21,000+ | VARIABLE (5% premium, 95% filler) | Wide variety, requires heavy curation | Ad-supported via SDK, licensed content available | MEDIUM — Volume source, needs aggressive filtering |
| **MarketJS** | 100+ | MEDIUM-HIGH (White-label) | White-label casual games | Commercial purchase per title | MEDIUM — Good for filling catalog gaps |
| **Softgames** | 300+ | HIGH (Mobile-first casual) | Bubble shooters, match-3, card games | B2B publisher agreements | HIGH — Strong casual/puzzle catalog |

